    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Exactly the Same line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, я сделал это.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I did it.' Max bursts in with a proud announcement of his cooking success.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что ты сделал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you make?' Confused by the sudden interruption, the boss asks for clarification.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я сделал ваш паштет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I made your pâté.' The young cook reveals he successfully recreated the signature dish of the restaurant.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мой паштет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My pâté?' Disbelief colours the boss's reaction as he repeats the claim as a question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Получилось один в один.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It came out exactly the same.' Using a common idiom that translates to 'one to one', the rookie boasts about his perfect copy.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я должен попробовать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I must taste it.' Refusing to take his word for it, the expert insists on checking the results himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже чуть-чуть лучше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even a little better.' Pushing his luck, the newcomer claims his version actually surpasses the original.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да ладно?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way!' An exclamation of total disbelief is thrown back at the arrogant claim.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah.' Standing his ground, the confident rookie confirms his bold statement.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Это невозможно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is impossible.' Still in denial, the master chef refuses to accept that his masterpiece could be duplicated.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я хороший повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a good cook.' A simple declaration of skill serves as the young man's ultimate defense.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
